ent-AshWalkerHuntRune = rune of the hunt
    .desc = A ring of angular signs etched into the ground. An intact goliath offered here lends strength to the tribe's hunters.
ent-AshWalkerMendingRune = rune of mending
    .desc = Interwoven signs circle a place for an offering. A watcher's life slowly mends the tribe's wounds.
ent-AshWalkerReturnRune = rune of return
    .desc = A closed circle surrounding the place of the fallen. Two worthy offerings and a blood tonic can call a tribesmate back to their body.
ent-ActionAshWalkerDrawHuntRune = Draw rune of the hunt
    .desc = Etch a rune into solid ground with your bone dagger.
ent-ActionAshWalkerDrawMendingRune = Draw rune of mending
    .desc = Etch a rune into solid ground with your bone dagger.
ent-ActionAshWalkerDrawReturnRune = Draw rune of return
    .desc = Etch a rune into solid ground with your bone dagger.
ent-AshWalkerHuntEffect = blessing of the hunt
ent-AshWalkerMendingEffect = mending blessing
ent-AshWalkerReturnWeaknessEffect = weakness after return
ash-walker-rune-invoke = Perform rite
ash-walker-rune-erase = Erase rune with dagger
ash-walker-rune-cannot-draw = You need clear solid ground on your home Lavaland and a bone dagger in hand.
ash-walker-rune-hunt-requirements = Offering: one intact dead goliath. Nearby tribesmates gain 15% additional damage against fauna for four minutes.
ash-walker-rune-mending-requirements = Offering: one intact dead watcher. Nearby living tribesmates recover 2 health every three seconds, up to 80 health over three minutes.
ash-walker-rune-return-requirements = Requires a fallen tribesmate's body, two intact goliaths, basilisks or watchers, and 10 units of blood tonic. A pale lava fish replaces one carcass. A spirit may return through this rite once.
ash-walker-rune-missing-offering = There are not enough suitable intact offerings near the rune.
ash-walker-rune-missing-tonic = An open vessel with 10 units of blood tonic must be near the rune or in your hand.
ash-walker-rune-no-spirit = No nearby tribesmate's body has a spirit that can return.
ash-walker-rune-already-blessed = Everyone present already carries this blessing.
ash-walker-rune-awaiting-spirit = The offerings are ready. The tribe awaits the spirit's answer.
ash-walker-rune-returned = The fallen tribesmate returns to life.
ash-walker-hunt-effect-examine = Dark marks of the hunting rite are visible on their skin.
ash-walker-mending-effect-examine = The edges of their wounds slowly close beneath pale ritual marks.
ash-walker-return-effect-examine = Their movements are slow and uncertain after a recent return.
ash-walker-return-title = Return to the tribe
ash-walker-return-accept = Return
ash-walker-return-decline = Remain
ash-walker-return-message = Your tribesmates have prepared offerings to return you to your body. Accept their call? You will retain wounds and suffer a minute of weakness. This rite cannot return you again this round.
